            The sequencer DMA-loads this shader into IMEM before running
            vertex transformations.  nogen: decoded in Borg.scala.";

    field {
        sw = rw; hw = r;
        desc = "Bits 19:0: 20-bit DRAM byte address of vertex shader.";
